NOTE ON ARTWORK AND GAME ASSETS

The PNG files under each mod's Textures/ folder are original artwork drawn for
this project by its author. They are licensed under the MIT terms above, on the
same basis as the source code.

This repository does not redistribute any "Probably Stolen" (深空当铺：可能是偷的)
game files. The projects reference the game's own assemblies at build time with
Private="false", so no game DLL, asset bundle or extracted sprite is checked in,
and builds do not copy game content into the output.
